00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>こわして　タントツゴール</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>走りつづけてないと</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>他に意味はないと</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>パンクな哲学なんだ</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>バイオリズムは　ツーバイリズムで</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>風景は　瞬間に　無数の線</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>俺を取り巻く風</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside 攻めて</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>いっさいがっさい　抜いて</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>誰ひとりも　何ひとつも</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>前を　行かせたくはない</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:36.110
Take this!

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.970
We're in big trouble.

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:06.270
We'll be fine. Have faith in Sonic.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:11.420
Episode 70

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:11.420
The Eggman Armada Appears!

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.780
This started three hours ago.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:19.410
We detected a Chaos Emerald that was moving.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.510
It's the Metarex!

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:37.590
They're chasing after someone.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:41.510
I'm detecting a Chaos Emerald from the unidentified ship in front.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.010
Please save him!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:49.390
The person in that spaceship might be in the same situation as us!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.560
Okay! Let's go, Chris!

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.310
Yeah.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:58.280
But we don't know who he is yet, so be careful!

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.910
They're already gone, Tails.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:06.370
Sheesh, they should at least let the Captain make his speech!

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.920
At this speed, we'll catch up in no time.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:19.380
I can already see it.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.640
That flying technique is crazy!

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.100
It's impressive in its own way.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.950
Oh, no you don't!

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:58.710
Thanks!

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.470
It warped!

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:13.390
You don't know where it warped to?

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:19.030
Judging from that ship's capabilities, it couldn't have warped very far.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:26.070
Due to the Metarex universe's unique static and space distortions, it's hard to search for it.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.280
But we'll figure it out soon.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.490
This is Knuckles in the engine room!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:32.410
Chris and Tails, come here quick!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.800
What's going on? Explain!

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:48.300
It might be due to the Metarex universe.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.720
What?

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.100
Then what's going to happen to the Master Emerald?

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:57.060
I never imagined something like this could happen!

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:00.820
Listen, this ship needs the Master Emerald!

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:05.320
I know! That's why I'm trying to figure out what to do!

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:10.740
That's enough, you two! We don't have time for this!

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:14.750
Knuckles, please trust me and Tails.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.630
Okay. Sorry, Tails.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:24.880
No, I'm sorry too. As the "cap"tain, I shouldn't have lost my "head".

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:29.970
Was that a pun? That was pretty bad.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.780
Tails!

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.940
Hey, Cosmo!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.280
How are things going?

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:51.200
I finished the program that alleviates unstable functions.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:55.250
But I needed more power than I thought to activate it.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:06:02.710
So I bypassed a section of the energy circuit, but now I have to adjust the master power's stability.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:07.720
I'm sorry. That was too technical.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:12.430
Yes, but you're wonderful when you're working hard.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:17.310
Tails, we've detected a Chaos Emerald!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:34.120
Those plasma bursts have tremendous energy!

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:38.290
If we go inside, the Blue Typhoon will be instantly destroyed!

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.330
How frightening...

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.930
Is the person inside okay?

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:50.720
Anyway, let's rescue him.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.640
Slowly moving forward!

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:01.520
The tractor beam is offline.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.610
Let's get closer and retrieve it using the manipulator.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:05.610
Roger.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.120
Gotcha!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.500
I'm gonna leave while I'm ahead!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:31.050
What's going on?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:34.100
Something is coming out from behind!

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.730
We're surrounded. It's a trap!

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:47.940
Typhoon, make a 180 degree turn!

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.700
Tails, look at that!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.960
Eggman joined forces with the Metarex?

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:12.720
Bow before the king!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:18.350
Four Metarex bosses, what do you think?

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:22.100
What do you think of my genius?

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:27.820
They fell for such a simple trick. They're not so special.

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:32.650
This strategy only worked because I know everything about Sonic.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:37.070
You need to take that into great consideration.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.870
Oh really?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.410
It's now time.

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:46.790
Follow my strategy and gradually corner them!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.000
Go!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.710
Yeah! Go!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:54.300
These newcomers have no right to talk!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.220
Cool it, Zelkova.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:09:01.100
We were only able to create this grand fleet because of Eggman's skills.

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:06.480
Dark Oak also ordered us to show Eggman our gratitude by following his strategy.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:08.110
But...

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.940
This means go!

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.320
Yeah! Go!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.280
Launch the Metarex fighter squad!

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:19.580
He said "Metarex" fighter squad.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.660
It's supposed to be "Eggman" fighter squad.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.370
How rude!

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:31.710
But don't you think Eggman is getting carried away?

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:37.180
Maybe he's sad because Shadow is gone.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.600
How heartbreaking...

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.610
They've started moving.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:10:01.240
Behind us is a wall of plasma bursts, and ahead of us are Metarex fighters! We're competely surrounded!

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:05.040
Let's destroy the fighters and create an opening!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.330
Sonic Fighters, attack!

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.210
What's that all about?

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.670
I'm talking about all of you.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:15.260
Give it a more lady-like name!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:18.220
Like the Amy and Sonic Chevaliers!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.760
Fine, so will you just go and attack?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:23.760
Here we go!

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:31.610
We're in big trouble.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.530
We'll be fine. Have faith in Sonic.

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:41.370
As long as we've deployed our fighters, their fleet can't afford to make careless maneuvers.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.780
Our chance will come, Cosmo!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.750
Thunderball Shoes!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.300
Watch this!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:09.270
Yes! Hat trick!

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.900
They're serious.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:17.240
Well, it's fine. Withdraw the fighter squad and concentrate our fire!

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:19.030
Dr. Eggman, that's fine but...

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:22.160
I don't like wasting time.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.280
I agree.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.910
Me too!

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:55.650
They're attacking their own people!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.740
I'm scared...

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.410
They're unbelievable!

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.960
Shields at 12%!

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:17.630
At this rate, we'll be destroyed! Isn't there anything we can do?

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:20.010
The enemy fleet is moving forward!

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.130
They're planning to destroy us in an instant!

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:28.180
We need to use the Sonic Driver to destroy the large battleship and break through the middle!

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.810
Roger!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.310
Targeting the enemy's large battleship!

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.860
Target locked on!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.650
Sonic, start your spin!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.120
Fire Sonic Driver!

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:03.670
Now! Click!

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:30.080
Sonic!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:33.830
Oh, no!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:46.340
Sonic Driver was unsuccessful...

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.530
The wall up ahead is weakening.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:15.450
If we can just restore the Master Emerald's power...

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:20.710
Let's use the minimum amount of energy we need to live and send the rest to the Master Emerald!

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:22.630
Tails?

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:24.920
Are you okay?

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.680
Yeah, I'm okay.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:35.730
Tormenting them slowly matches my style.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:40.400
All ships, lock your cannons on Blue Typhoon!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.730
When the wall vanishes, everyone fires at the same time!

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:53.330
They've locked on to Blue Typhoon!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:57.290
When the wall vanishes, they're all going to attack simultaneously.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:06.340
I don't know what to do anymore!

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.630
Tails!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:12.800
I'm back!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:15.930
Welcome back, Dr. Eggman.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:19.020
The wall will vanish in five minutes.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:21.980
You have great timing. You can watch with pride.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:25.190
They will no longer get in our way.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.440
Don't talk about them!

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.780
Five minutes left...

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.740
Please wait, Tails!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:41.330
We're in this situation because I made the wrong choices.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.580
It's not your fault, Tails!

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:46.880
Eggman played me perfectly.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:50.300
I'm not qualified to be captain!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:54.760
That's not true! You're a great captain, Tails!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.680
I've lost my confidence.

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:04.810
Tails, you told me last time not to keep my worries bottled up.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:05.860
Therefore...

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.110
Therefore?

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:15.240
Tails, please believe in us. Because we believe in you!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.790
Cosmo...

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:24.920
How does it feel to have a sword at your throat?

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.710
This is because you betrayed us, Eggman!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:33.760
What a weird thing to say, kid. Betray you?

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:37.050
We were always enemies.

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:43.480
But since we've known each other for a long time, I'll leave you with a parting gift.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:46.610
The wall will vanish in five minutes.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:51.690
You can commit suicide by flying into the wall, or you can wait to be attacked.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.110
Either way, you'll be in pain.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.040
What should we do?

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:02.160
We're finished.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:05.170
It's too soon to give up, Chris.

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:09.300
We still have five minutes!

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:10.710
Tails!

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:13.720
Let's reanalyze all our data immediately.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.470
Roger!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:28.230
The rear wall spins and creates a powerful magnetic field.

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:36.610
If we reverse the direction of the spin, we'll create an opposing magnetic field, and the wall will release tremendous energy.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:39.450
That will destroy our ship!

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.950
The wall will release energy when it's destroyed.

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:45.330
If we concentrate our shields on the front side, we'll survive.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:48.130
But there's one problem.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:53.840
We need to use Ring Road for this plan to work, but Sonic is really hurt.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.970
Don't worry about me!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.180
Sonic!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:00.350
I have complete faith in Tails.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:03.680
If there's even the slight chance that this will work, then let's try it!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:06.020
Thank you, Sonic!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:20.320
Sonic is taking off!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.870
Don't they realize that there's nothing they can do?

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.710
The Master Emerald is stable!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.250
We only have one chance at this!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:34.590
We'll use Ring Road to create a fast spin in the opposite direction of the wall's spin!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:35.550
Okay!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.840
Ring Road!

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:51.770
The wall will vanish in 5 seconds...

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.900
4... 3... 2...

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.990
1... 0!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:15.920
Nothing is happening.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:17.300
Oh no...

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:37.110
Sonic!

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:44.490
Sonic!

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:51.170
All ships, attack!

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:53.630
The target is the Blue Typhoon!

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.380
Fire!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.420
Incoming enemy missiles from six o'clock!

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:00.970
We can't dodge them all!

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.770
They'll hit us in 30 seconds!

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.230
Tails!

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:37.130
Okay! Concentrate the shields on the front of our ship!

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.840
Full speed ahead!

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:47.510
Our engine power isn't increasing!

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:49.350
It's the Master Emerald!

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:57.320
Wait for me, Master Emerald.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:01.740
Please, Blue Typhoon!

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:06.370
No!

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.040
