00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:14.460
The seven chaos.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:22.170
Chaos is power. Power comes from the heart!

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:24.760
Go!

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.980
